# Shipped file templates, not source. The *.lua ones use placeholder syntax
# ("${name}", "$1") and do not parse as Lua -- stylua aborts the whole run on
# the first of them, which is why `stylua .` could not be used here at all.
# .luacheckrc excludes the same directory, for the same reason.
lua/filetree/assets/templates/

# Sample projects for the reference-engine harness, not part of the plugin.
TESTS/refs/fixtures/
